"code": "nqxc2gc17jd1", "name": "Incident on 2017-02-28 18:00:27 UTC", "message": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-28 18:00:27</strong> - We are investigating issues serving web hooks as well as assets on GitHub.com.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-28 19:32:55</strong> - Webhooks are now delivering normally but webhook logs will be delayed. We are continuing to monitor other assets recovery.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-28 22:35:12</strong> - Webhook logs found in the \"Recent Deliveries\" section of the settings page will be delayed as they're processed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-03-01 04:37:42</strong> - Everything operating normally.</li>\n</ul>", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Feb <var data-var='date'>28</var>, <var data-var='time'>18:00</var> - <var data-var='time'>18:00</var> UTC"}, {"code": "58gbd8ck7pk6", "name": "Incident on 2017-02-22 16:47:47 UTC", "message": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-22 16:47:47</strong> - GitHub Pages builds are temporarily paused for unscheduled maintenance. GitHub Pages sites remain available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-22 17:03:38</strong> - GitHub Pages builds have resumed. Delays may continue as we work through the backlog.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-22 17:35:59</strong> - Everything operating normally.</li>\n</ul>", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Feb <var data-var='date'>22</var>, <var data-var='time'>16:47</var> - <var data-var='time'>16:47</var> UTC"}, {"code": "m9gtpnpr0x4t", "name": "Incident on 2017-02-08 17:21:21 UTC", "message": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-08 17:21:21</strong> - We're investigating delays processing repository push events.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-08 17:53:54</strong> - Everything operating normally.</li>\n</ul>", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Feb <var data-var='date'>8</var>, <var data-var='time'>17:21</var> - <var data-var='time'>17:21</var> UTC"}, {"code": "6q7hmswht32x", "name": "Incident on 2017-02-02 19:39:29 UTC", "message": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-02 19:39:29</strong> - Minor service outage.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-02 19:46:29</strong> - We are investigating delays with webhook deliveries.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-02 19:58:47</strong> - We are processing the webhook delivery backlog. You may continue to experience delays as we work through the queue.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2017-02-02 20:13:46</strong> - Everything operating normally.</li>\n</ul>", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Feb <var data-var='date'>2</var>, <var data-var='time'>19:39</var> - <var data-var='time'>19:39</var> UTC"}]}], "show_component_filter": false, "show_uptime_calendar": true, "component_filter": null, "start_time": "2017-02-01T00:00:00Z", "end_time": "2017-04-30T23:59:59Z"}